zone:0:200:0:200:0:200:a fairly sized jungle, glowing with wildlife. everywhere you look you see creatures which could exist only in dreems and imimaginations. the very site of these creatures fills you with respect and wonder. their every action is graceful, their appearance only able to be defined as magistic. the sheere beauty and magisty of these creatures can only be rivled by their fantastic powers. each of them could destroy you, or any other human with just a few strikes. you know they are deadly, you know they have been seeled here for a reason. yet you are still entranced by them, almost enchanted
